{"articleNo":"313994","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=313994&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [과총] 2021 한민족청년과학도포럼(YGF) 홍보","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.06.29","hit":"8844","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span id=\"view_subject_txt\" style=\"font-family: Dotum,돋움,sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><strong>[과총] 2021</strong></strong> <strong><strong>한민족청년과학도포럼(YGF) 홍보</strong></strong></span></p><p><span><br></span></p><span><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">안녕하세요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">한국과학기술단체총연합회입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">2021&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">한민족청년 과학도 포럼</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">(Young Generation Forum,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">이하&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">YGF)’&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;YGF</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">는 미주를 비롯한 유럽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">아시아</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">, CIS</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">지역에서&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">권역별로 해외동포 청년과학기술인과 국내 청년과학기술인이 함께 참여해&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">첨단과학기술의 상호교류의 장을 마련하고자 개최됩니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">관심 있는 학생분들께서 참여하실 수 있도록 적극적인 관심을 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 21.33px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&